      "body": "@JoelProminic , @JustinProminic - I have added privacy policy to Moonshine - it's under menu **Help** -> **Privacy Policy**. However I have one issue. I loaded privacy policy from HTML, because it's the easiest way of displaying it and have looking as it is in document.\r\nIn order to load that html I used class called [FlexHTMLLoader](https://flex.apache.org/asdoc/mx/core/FlexHTMLLoader.html). In order to display what's is loaded I need to use UIComponent class, FlexHTMLLoader cannot be added to spark components. Unfortunately UIComponent doesn't have scrollbar, so I need to work a bit more in order to add those to displayed html. Currently you can scroll all content by mouse, but scrollbar is not visible. \r\nWe can move slowly forward with release - I will try to work on that tomorrow more. ",
